<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 88-3 V PAKISTAN IN 2ND INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 88-3 V PAKISTAN IN 2ND INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 88 for three in their second innings, 52 runs ahead, at the close of the second day of the first cricket test against Pakistan on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:  New Zealand 155 and 88-3,  Pakistan 191.</p>
